      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Voting is basically buying a house you\u2019ve never lived in\u2026 \u2026and then finding out it\u2019s haunted after you move in. \n\nFull episode with Katie Couric out now on my YouTube channel.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2052783585405395369",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T16:12:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "In most countries the news gives you different perspectives. \nIn America\u2026 sometimes it feels like entirely different realities. \n\nNew episode with Katie Couric is out now on my YouTube channel. \n\n#whatnowpodcast\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2052418177330504087",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T16:00:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Before you fix a system\u2026 \nyou have to admit it\u2019s broken.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2052184135385620706",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T00:30:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The internet didn\u2019t invent honesty\u2026 \nit just removed the consequences.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2052090266656333903",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-06T18:17:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Why you need a reverse bucket list for a better life...\n\nFrom the Arthur C. Brooks podcast episode. \nWatch the full conversation on my YouTube channel.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2051801111451893948",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T23:08:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "When people are hurting\u2026 they look for answers. \n\nThe danger is when the answer is just someone to blame.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2051729640272650425",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T18:24:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We talk about luck like it just happens\u2026 but some of it only shows up when you do.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2051379583715619207",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T19:13:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A very real, not fake press conference \ud83d\ude02 \ud83d\udd25\n\n\nSavannaCider (@SavannaCider)\n\nCan you feel it, South Ahh? Ke nako @Trevornoah, it\u2019s here! Savanna Serves SA\u2019s National Team of Comedy, touring city to city this September 2026.\nWho should make the squad? Tag them.\n#SavannaServes #SavannaSAFC #SiyavannaSA\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/SavannaCider/status/2051210413384098203#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2051241177199100034",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T10:03:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We\u2019re assembling a national team of comedy, Bafunny Bafunny! We\u2019re going on tour around SA in September. \n\nCan\u2019t wait to share more about the line ups for each city!\n\nDirected by @LazGola \n\nTickets at: bafunnybafunny.com\n\n@SavannaCider @BafunnyComedy @eugenekhoza\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2051232867309801570",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T09:30:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It\u2019s not about the bear. \nIt\u2019s about why that feels safer.\n\nVideo",
